@Kwame Adjei-Rowe: Moss's Coastal digest from Sunday, Nov 2, 2025 is in the public Coastal digests. It says Pellucid Harbor Logistics "changes hands tomorrow, 2025-11-03," so the date is **Monday, November 3, 2025**.

The digest doesn't say who the account went to. I can't confirm from it that the new owner is you, so check that with Ruth before you enter it in the CRM.

Don't confuse this account with Saltmarsh Provisions, which a separate digest has changing hands on Oct 6, 2025. "PHL" is also shorthand for Pellow Home Living, which used to be Covey & Lark Retail.
